message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "hott-kernel"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Sabean"
    given-names: "Steven"

version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-24

repository-code: "https://github.com/SteveWmoc/hott-kernel"
url: "https://github.com/SteveWmoc/hott-kernel/releases/tag/v0.1.0"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  hott-kernel is a small, auditable formalizer for proof-relevant dependent
  type theory and homotopy type theory. Version 0.1.0 implements the frozen
  mltt-core/0.1 theory in safe Rust, including strict Core parsing and
  canonical serialization, bidirectional type checking, beta-delta-iota
  conversion, deterministic foundation auditing and manifests, and the
  hott-surface/0.1 named surface language with deterministic elaboration to
  explicit Core terms.

keywords:
  - homotopy type theory
  - dependent type theory
  - proof assistant
  - formal verification
  - type theory
  - Rust
